@startuml Initializing memory with a delay block to adjust timing
== Initialization ==
"Application" -> "XSPI" : HAL_XSPI_Init()
"XSPI" --> "Application" : HAL_OK or HAL_INVALID_PARAM
"Application" -> "System" : XSPI HW Initialization
note right: Initialize GPIO
"System" --> "Application"
== Configuration ==
"Application" -> "XSPI" : HAL_XSPI_SetConfig()
note right: Global configuration
"XSPI" --> "Application" : HAL_OK or HAL_ERROR or HAL_INVALID_PAR
"Application" -> "XSPI" : HAL_XSPI_DLYB_SetConfigDelay()
note right: Set delay block configuration
"XSPI" --> "Application" : HAL_OK or HAL_ERROR or HAL_INVALID_PAR
"Application" -> "XSPI" : HAL_XSPI_DLYB_Enable();
"XSPI" --> "Application"
== Process polling mode ==
note over XSPI, Application: **Continue the process operations according to the targeted scenario**

@enduml